### Attendance
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance?from={{fromDate}}&to={{toDate}}

### Filter attendance by employee and status
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance?employeeId={{employeeId}}&from={{fromDate}}&to={{toDate}}&status=PRESENT

### Create attendance
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}",
  "date": "2026-08-27",
  "checkIn": "08:03",
  "checkOut": "17:02",
  "status": "PRESENT",
  "note": "Arrived a few minutes late"
}

### Reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/attendance?from={{fromDate}}&to={{toDate}}

### Department attendance report
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/department-attendance?from={{fromDate}}&to={{toDate}}
